OL,5,G1700 5 News with Dan Walker
OL,6,G1800 Cornwall: A Year by the Sea
OL,7,     FIn Padstow harbour, a fisherman
OL,8,     Ftries an innovative way of
OL,9,     Fcatching scallops with illuminated
OL,10,     Fpots. In Fowey, children learn the
OL,11,     Fskills that have shaped the town's
OL,12,     Fmaritime heritage.
OL,13,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,14,     FA van driver blocks himself into a
OL,15,     Fdead end and repeatedly rams the
OL,16,     Finterceptors' car, while elsewhere
OL,17,     Fa self-confident drink driver gets
OL,18,     Fargumentative.
